    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "Livana Böhn"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 484,
      "text": "“March 1, 2023\nINDIANAPOLIS, March 1, 2023 /PRNewswire/ -- Eli Lilly and Company (NYSE: LLY) today announced price reductions of 70% for its most commonly\nprescribed insulins and an expansion of its Insulin Value Program that caps patient out-of-pocket costs at $35 or less per month. Lilly is taking these\nactions to make it easier to access Lilly insulin and help Americans who may have difficulty navigating a  healthcare system that may keep\nthem from getting affordable insulin.“"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 25,
      "text": "Eli Lilly Company (2023) "
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 11,
      "text": "Livana Böhn"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 52,
      "text": "Was it an act of goodwill or due to public pressure?"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 33,
      "text": "Eli Lilly‘s insulin price capping"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 240,
      "text": "“…Insulin costs less than $10 to make, but Americans are sometimes forced to pay over $300 for it. It’s flat wrong“ (l.7-9)\n\n„I called on pharma companies to bring prices down for everyone on their own. Today, Eli Lilly did that“ (l.11-12)\n"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 101,
      "text": "The white House (2023, March 1)\n Statement from President Joe Biden on Action to Lower Insulin Costs\n"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 492,
      "text": "For far too long, American families have been crushed by drug costs many times higher than what people in other countries are charged for the same prescriptions. Insulin costs less than $10 to make, but Americans are sometimes forced to pay over $300 for it. It’s flat wrong.For far too long, American families have been crushed by drug costs many times higher than what people in other countries are charged for the same prescriptions. Insulin costs less than $10 to make, but Americans are "
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 71,
      "text": "“7 years of work we‘ve been doing to reduce the prices of our insulins“"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 106,
      "text": "“…With the change last years in the medicare department …to 35$. We think that should be the new standart“"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 62,
      "text": "Don Lemon, CNN (2023, March 1)\n Interview with CEO Dave Ricks\n"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 26,
      "text": "Dave Ricks,Elli Lilly 2026"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 33,
      "text": "Eli Lilly (2026)\nWikepedia (2026)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 15,
      "text": "founded in 1876"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 171,
      "text": "“The Biden administration has pressed the industry to rein in prices, which have skyrocketed in recent years and weighed on lower- and middle-income people with diabetes.“"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 94,
      "text": "Daniel Gilbert and Aaron Gregg\nThe Whashington Post                            (2023, March 1)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 172,
      "text": "“ Uninsured Americans pay nearly $98 on average for a vial of Eli Lilly‘s generic insulin, even after the company pledged to cut the products‘s list price to $25 per vial…“"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 93,
      "text": "Annika Kim Konstantino\nCNB                                                    (2023, July 13)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 90,
      "text": "Brooke Singman \nFoxNews                                                    (2023, March 1)"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 122,
      "text": "“What the GOP needs to reverse is their support for higher drug costs and the biggest cut to Medicare benefits in decades“"
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 1,
      "text": "￼"
    },
    {
      "kind": "NOTE",
      "characters": 0,
      "text": ""
    },
    {
      "kind": "TEXTBOX",
      "characters": 22,
      "text": "What‘s the conclusion?"
    },
